Cell["\<\
A 3-array has no flat picture of its own, so it is drawn as a row of \
matrices, the first index choosing the matrix:\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"58328e68-54a5-e949-8b3e-0d3410f849f3"],

Cell["ArrayGraphics[Array[#1 + #2 + #3 &, {2, 2, 2}]]", "Input",ExpressionUUID->"28c51fe2-4abb-8542-b042-b2adfe0d46d2"],

